Hi <%= @liaison.name.split.first %>,

You've been assigned to <%= @event.title %> (<%= @assignment.assignment_method.capitalize %>-assigned<%= @assignment.score ? ", score #{@assignment.score.round}" : "" %>).

Date: <%= @event.starts_at.strftime("%A, %B %-d, %Y") %>
Time: <%= @event.starts_at.strftime("%H:%M") %>-<%= @event.ends_at.strftime("%H:%M") %>
Location: <%= [@event.venue_name, @event.address, @event.city].select(&:present?).join(", ") %>
<% if @event.drive_time_minutes -%>
Drive from HQ: <%= @event.drive_time_minutes %>m (<%= @event.drive_distance_miles %>mi each way)
<% end -%>
Prep / teardown: <%= @event.prep_minutes %>m / <%= @event.teardown_minutes %>m
<% if @event.estimated_attendees.present? -%>
Expected attendees: <%= @event.estimated_attendees %>
<% end -%>

Requester: <%= @event.requester_organization %> - <%= @event.requester_name %><%= " · #{@event.requester_phone}" if @event.requester_phone.present? %>
<%= @event.requester_email %>
<% if @event.event_material_items.any? -%>

Materials & equipment:
<% @event.event_material_items.each do |item| -%>
- <%= item.material_item.name %><%= " (#{item.quantity})" if item.quantity.present? %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

View this event: <%= event_url(@event) %>
